cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Speech Background Noise Suppression with Deep Learning"
abstract: >-
  End-to-end MATLAB implementation of speech background-noise
  suppression: classical baselines (Boll spectral subtraction,
  Ephraim-Malah decision-directed Wiener filtering), a compact CNN
  ideal-ratio-mask model trained on VoiceBank-DEMAND, and a fully
  verified evaluation (segmental SNR, log-spectral distance, STOI
  cross-checked against the reference implementation, and SI-SDR)
  on the corpus's standard 824-file test set.
authors:
  - family-names: Chhunchha
    given-names: Karan
    email: karanchhunchha@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/Karanchhunchha/Speech-Background-Noise-Suppression-with-Deep-Learning"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - speech enhancement
  - noise suppression
  - deep learning
  - MATLAB
  - VoiceBank-DEMAND
  - STOI
